{"created": "2021-11-26T12:01:46.322376+00:00", "modified": "2021-11-30T00:08:16.065165+00:00", "id": 5729444, "conceptrecid": "4515139", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.4515139", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "metadata": {"title": "CCAM: China Catchment Attributes and Meteorology dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "publication_date": "2021-11-30", "description": "<p>This repository contains the dataset supporting the paper: CCAM: China Catchment Attributes and Meteorology dataset.</p>\n\n<p>It consists of two parts: CCAM: China Catchment Attributes and Meteorology dataset and HydroMLYR.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The first dataset provides daily meteorological time series and 120+ attributes for 4911 catchments in China. The daily meteorological time series include (i) precipitation, (ii) temperature, (iii) evapotranspiration, (iv) wind speed, (v) ground surface temperature, (vi) pressure, (vii) humidity, (viii) sunshine duration and (ix) potential evapotranspiration. The catchment attributes include properties such as (i) topography, (ii) climate, (iii) hydrology, (iv) land cover, (v) geology, and (vi) soil.</p>\n\n<p>HydroMLYR provides daily meteorological time series, standardized weekly averaged streamflow and 120+ attributes for 102 catchments.</p>\n\n<p>Accompanying code: https://github.com/haozhen315/CCAM-China-Basin-Attributes-and-Meteorology-dataset</p>\n\n<p>The open-source&nbsp;code&nbsp;supports generating 120+ basin attributes for custom basins given a single or several basin boundaries.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em>(9_code_data.zip</em>&nbsp;contains part of the data that the user will need to run the code. Refer to the GitHub repository or paper for details.)</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Zhen Hao", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research", "orcid": "0000-0002-1710-9614"}, {"name": "Jin Jin", "affiliation": "School of Computer Science, Northwestern Polytechnical University"}, {"name": "Runliang Xia", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Shimin Tian", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Wushuang Yang", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Qixing Liu", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Min Zhu", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Tao Ma", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}, {"name": "Chengran Jing", "affiliation": "Yellow River Institute of Hydraulic Research"}], "keywords": ["china, large sample hydrology, catchment attributes, meteorology, yellow river"], "version": "2.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Journal article", "type": "publication", "subtype": "article"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 13, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "4515139"}}]}}, "title": "CCAM: China Catchment Attributes and Meteorology dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5729444", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5729444", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/5729444?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.5729444", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5729444/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/4515139", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/4515139", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4515139", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.4515139", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5729444/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:5729444/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5729444/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/5729444/media-files", 